OL,3,GNEWSAHousing scheme prepares for first
OL,4,Aresidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty family homes are ready to move
OL,7,Finto at a former city centre industrial
OL,8,Fsite that will provide hundreds of
OL,9,Fhouses in total.
OL,11,FHalf of the 378 family houses at
OL,12,FWolverhampton's #150m Canalside South
OL,13,Fscheme had been sold to owner-occupiers
OL,14,Fand investors, with 131 plots bought by
OL,15,Fa company for rental, the city council
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FBy mid 2030, more than 530
OL,19,Fenergy-efficient houses and apartments
OL,20,Fwill be completed, complemented by
OL,21,Fcommercial and community amenities.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
