OL,3,GNEWSAHousing scheme prepares for first
OL,4,Aresidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project at the 17-acre site, which
OL,7,Fpreviously included a British Steel
OL,8,Fplant, will bring back into use land
OL,9,Fderelict for more than 15 years.
